# Web3Forms access key for the contact form.
# Get a free key at https://web3forms.com using the inbox that should receive
# messages (sunainatakhi64@gmail.com), then paste it after the = sign.
# It is a public key by design (it ships in the site's JavaScript).
# While empty, "Send by email" opens the visitor's own email app instead.
REACT_APP_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
